 character;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (f)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the maintenance of a fixed place of business solely for any combination of activities mentioned in subparagraphs (a) to (e), provided that the overall activity of the fixed place of business resulting from this combination is of a preparatory or auxiliary character.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , where a person - other than an agent of an independent status to whom the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 6}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  apply - is acting on behalf of an enterprise and has, and habitually exercises, in a Contracting Party an authority to conclude contracts in the name of the enterprise, that enterprise shall be deemed to have a permanent establishment in that Contracting Party in respect of any activities which that person undertakes for the enterprise, unless the activities of such person are limited to those mentioned in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  which, if exercised through a fixed place of business, would not make this fixed place of business a permanent establishment under the provisions of that paragraph.\par }}

{\sect \sectd }\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 An enterprise shall not be deemed to have a permanent establishment in a Contracting Party merely because it carries on business in that Contracting Party through a broker, general commission agent or any other agent of an independent status, provided that such persons are acting in the ordinary course of their business.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The fact that a company which is a resident of a Contracting Party controls or is controlled by a company which is a resident of the other Contracting Party, or which carries on business in that other Contracting Party (whether through a permanent establishment or otherwise), shall not of itself constitute either company a permanent establishment of the other.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 6\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 INCOME FROM IMMOVABLE PROPERTY\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Income derived by a resident of a Contracting Party from immovable property (including income from agriculture or forestry) situated in the other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Contracting Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The term \u8220??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 immovable property}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u8221?? shall have the meaning which it has under the laws of the Contracting Party in which the property in question is situated. The term shall in any case include property accessory to immovable property, livestock and equipment used in agriculture and forestry, rights to which the provisions of general law respecting landed property apply, usufruct of immovable property and rights to variable or fixed payments as consideration for the working of, or the right to work, mineral deposits, quarries, sources and other natural resources; ships and aircraft shall not be regarded as immovable property.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Any property or right referred to in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall be regarded as situated where the land, standing timber, mineral deposits, quarries, sources or natural resources, as the case may be, are situated or where the working may take place.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall apply to income derived from the direct use, letting, or use in any other form of immovable property.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall also apply to the income from immovable property of an enterprise.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 7\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 BUSINESS PROFITS\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The profits of an enterprise of a Contracting Party shall be taxable only in that Contracting Party unless the enterprise carries on business in the other Contracting Party through a permanent establishment situated therein. If the enterprise carries on business as aforesaid, the profits of the enterprise may be taxed in that other Contracting Party but only so much of them as is attributable to that permanent establishment.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Subject to the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , where an enterprise of a Contracting Party carries on business in the other Contracting Party through a permanent establishment situated therein, there shall in each Contracting Party be attributed to that permanent establishment the profits which it might be expected to make if it were a distinct and separate enterprise engaged in the same or similar activities under the same or similar conditions and dealing wholly independently with the enterprise of which it is a permanent establishment.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In determining the profits of a permanent establishment, there shall be allowed as deductions expenses which are incurred for the purposes of the permanent establishment, including executive and general administrative expenses so incurred, whether in the Contracting Party in which the permanent establishment is situated or elsewhere.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Insofar as it has been customary in a Contracting Party to determine the profits to be attributed to a permanent establishment on the basis of an apportionment of the total profits of the enterprise to its various parts, nothing in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall preclude that Contracting Party from determining the profits to be taxed by such an apportionment as may be customary; the method of apportionment adopted shall, however, be such that the result shall be in accordance with the principles contained in this Article.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 No profits shall be attributed to a permanent establishment by reason of the mere purchase by that permanent establishment of goods or merchandise for the enterprise.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of the preceding paragraphs of this Article, the profits to be attributed to the permanent establishment shall be determined by the same method year by year unless there is good and sufficient reason to the contrary.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}

{\sect \sectd }\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where profits include items of income which are dealt with separately in other Articles of this Agreement, then the provisions of those Articles shall not be affected by the provisions of this Article.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 8\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 INTERNATIONAL TRAFFIC\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Profits of an enterprise of a Contracting Party from the operation of ships or aircraft in international traffic shall be taxable only in that Contracting Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding the provisions of Article 2, where an enterprise of a Contracting Party carries on the operation of ships or aircraft in international traffic, that enterprise, if an enterprise of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, shall be exempt from the enterprise tax of Japan, and, if an enterprise of Japan, shall be exempt from any tax similar to the enterprise tax of Japan which may hereafter be imposed in the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of the preceding paragraphs of this Article shall also apply to profits from the participation in a pool, a joint business or an international operating agency.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 9\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 ASSOCIATED ENTERPRISES\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 Where\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 an enterprise of a Contracting Party participates directly or indirectly in the management, control or capital of an enterprise of the other Contracting Party, or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the same persons participate directly or indirectly in the management, control or capital of an enterprise of a Contracting Party and an enterprise of the other Contracting Party,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 and in either case conditions are made or imposed between the two enterprises in their commercial or financial relations which differ from those which would be made between independent enterprises, then any profits which would, but for those conditions, have accrued to one of the enterprises, but, by reason of those conditions, have not so accrued, may be included in the profits of that enterprise and taxed accordingly.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where a Contracting Party includes, in accordance with the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , in the profits of an enterprise of that Contracting Party - and taxes accordingly - profits on which an enterprise of the other Contracting Party has been charged to tax in that other Contracting Party and where the competent authorities of the Contracting Parties agree, upon consultation, that all or part of the profits so included are profits which would have accrued to the enterprise of the first-mentioned Contracting Party if the conditions made between the two enterprises had been those which would have been made between independent enterprises, then that other Contracting Party shall make an appropriate adjustment to the amount of the tax charged therein on those agreed profits. In determining such adjustment, due regard shall be had to the other provisions of this Agreement.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , a Contracting Party shall not change the profits of an enterprise of that Contracting Party in the circumstances referred to in that paragraph after seven years from the end of the taxable year in which the profits that would be subjected to such change would, but for the conditions referred to in that paragraph, have accrued to that enterprise. The provisions of this paragraph shall not apply in the case of fraud or wilful default.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 10\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 DIVIDENDS\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Dividends paid by a company which is a resident of a Contracting Party to a resident of the other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Contracting Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 However, such dividends may also be taxed in the Contracting Party of which the company paying the dividends is a resident and according to the laws of that Contracting Party, but if the beneficial owner of the dividends is a resident of the other Contracting Party, the tax so charged shall not exceed:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 5 per cent of the gross amount of the dividends if the beneficial owner is a company that has owned directly or indirectly, for the period of six months ending on the date on which entitlement to the dividends is determined, at least 10 per cent of the voting shares of the company paying the dividends; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 10 per cent of the gross amount of the dividends in all other cases.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 This paragraph shall not affect the taxation of the company in respect of the profits out of which the dividends are paid.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of subparagraph (a) of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall not apply in the case of dividends paid by a company which is entitled to a deduction for dividends paid to its beneficiaries in computing its taxable income in Japan.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The term \u8220??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 dividends}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u8221?? as used in this Article means income from shares or other rights, not being debt-claims, participating in profits, as well as all other income which is subjected to the same taxation treatment as income from shares by the tax laws of the Contracting Party of which the company making the distribution is a resident.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall not apply if the beneficial owner of the dividends, being a resident of a Contracting Party, carries on business in the other Contracting Party of which the company paying the dividends is a resident through a permanent establishment situated therein and the holding in respect of which the dividends are paid is effectively connected with such permanent establishment. In such case the provisions of Article 7 shall apply.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where a company which is a resident of a Contracting Party derives profits or income from the other Contracting Party, that other Contracting Party may not impose any tax on the dividends paid by the company, except insofar as such dividends are paid to a resident of that other Contracting Party or insofar as the holding in respect of which the dividends are paid is effectively connected with a permanent establishment situated in that other Contracting Party, nor subject the company\u8217??s undistributed profits to a tax on the company\u8217??s undistributed profits, even if the dividends paid or the undistributed profits consist wholly or partly of profits or income arising in such other Contracting Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 11\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 INTEREST\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Interest arising in a Contracting Party and paid to a resident of the other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Contracting Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 However, such interest may also be taxed in the Contracting Party in which it arises and according to the laws of that Contracting Party, but if the beneficial owner of the interest is a resident of the other Contracting Party, the tax so charged shall not exceed 10 per cent of the gross amount of the interest.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\pla